OL,3,AElla Langley sweeps Country Music      
OL,4,AAwards as Taylor Swift performs        
OL,6,FUS singer Ella Langley has swept the   
OL,7,FCountry Music Association Awards       
OL,8,F(CMAs), following the huge success of  
OL,9,Fher breakthrough hit Choosin' Texas.   
OL,11,FThe Alabama-born singer was named      
OL,12,Fentertainer of the year at Wednesday's 
OL,13,Fceremony, weeks after the song became  
OL,14,Fthe longest-running number one in      
OL,15,FBillboard chart history.               
OL,17,F"At this point, I'm sick of me," the   
OL,18,F27-year-old joked in her acceptance    
OL,19,Fspeech, having spent so much of the    
OL,20,Fceremony on stage. "I could quit       
OL,21,Ftomorrow and have the best career of my
OL,22,Flife."                                 
